@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### A good reading
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/meter-readings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "meterId": "MTR-1001",
  "volume": 125.4,
  "unit": "MCF",
  "readAt": "2026-10-27T14:30:00Z"
}

### A bad reading that is accepted today (this is the bug the work item fixes)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/meter-readings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "meterId": "",
  "volume": -50,
  "unit": "gallons",
  "readAt": "2099-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### Readings for one meter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/meter-readings?meterId=MTR-1001
